            "block_content": "NOTE 5 For example, if the EVCC sends a CertificateInstallationReq containing OEM provisioning certificate based on algorithm defined in [V2G20-2674] but the SA's configuration in [V2G20-2320] indicates usage of algorithm defined in [V2G20-2319], the SA fails to verify the signatures received in CertificateInstallationReq message.",
